			<name>Acrobat</name>
			<description>Having trained from a young age, you're capable of amazing feats of daring. You gain a +1 bonus on Acrobatics checks, and you take only a -2 penalty instead of the normal -5 penalty when using the Climb skill to attempt an accelerated climb.</description>
